    <tags>marksmith markdown pdf docx converter editor ai chatgpt gemini claude documents winui</tags>
    <summary>Turn AI chats into polished PDF and DOCX documents.</summary>
    <description>
Marksmith is a native WinUI 3 desktop app that turns Markdown — especially replies from
ChatGPT, Gemini, and Claude — into professional **PDF** or **DOCX** documents.

- Detects the AI source and normalizes the quirks each assistant leaves behind (LaTeX
  delimiters, `【n†source】` citation pips, pseudo-headings).
- Renders with proper math (KaTeX), syntax highlighting, Mermaid diagrams, and ten themes.
- Works as a plain live Markdown editor, watches folders/clipboard for hands-free
  conversion, and exposes a local REST API plus a companion browser extension.

Requires Windows 11 (x64). The .NET runtime and Windows App SDK are bundled — nothing else
to install.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/thebubbsy/marksmith/releases/tag/v1.1.1</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
